         trivia = "Level created on July 9, 2026\nUpdates:\nAugust 4, 2026 - Finally started adding OOB triggers to this level. Added all walls, floors, and ceilings up until first Railgun interior, including floor for entire lower area there, and then also added higher OOB ceiling for high Railgun, Verticality, Maximo Center, and Advanced Techniques.\nAugust 8, 2026 - Added ALL the rest of the OOB floors, ceilings, and walls.\nAugust 15, 2026 - Added challenge times, hints, and trivia.\nAugust 15, 2026 - Added camera path and icon picture.\nAugust 15, 2026 - Changed existing help bubbles and added a lot of new ones.\nTrivia:\nUnlike Tutorial Course this level has no nest eggs. As stated in the level, I tried to put Side Stroller where it normally falls, but it got in the way of Having a Blast, so I had to move it to the end. And funnily enough, despite this level being significantly longer than Tutorial Course, it has 3 fewer gems!";
